<title>FRANCE: Scor insurer premiums rise in 1996.</title>
<headline>Scor insurer premiums rise in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Gross reinsurance premiums   13,815    vs   11,848</p>
<p>	  Fourth quarter:	     5,203    vs    3,148</p>
<p>NOTE - The French reinsurer issued the figures in the BALO legal announcements bulletin and said that at constant exchange rates turnover rose 12.9 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
